      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<Page>/\n├── <Page>.md        released Page\n├── draft/\n│   ├── draft.md     working source\n│   ├── runs/        RP records\n│   └── results/     snapshots\n├── evidence/\n│   ├── evidence.md  requirements + links\n│   ├── runs/        RE records\n│   └── results/     evidence + provenance\n├── delivery/\n│   ├── web/\n│   │   ├── runs/\n│   │   └── output/\n│   ├── latex/\n│   │   ├── runs/\n│   │   └── output/\n│   └── word/\n│       ├── runs/\n│       └── output/\n└── workflow/        coordination",
