      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# Introduction\n\n## Structure\n### C1.P1 · Prescribing behavior\n| Bullet | Point          | Evidence |\n|--------|----------------|----------|\n| B1     | Set importance | None     |\n| B2     | Show variation | E01      |\n\n## Scratch\n### C1.P1\n- Clarify the comparison.\n- Keep the opening focused.\n\n## Draft\n### C1.P1 · Prescribing behavior\nWrite the paragraph here as ordinary\nprose, with its evidence citations.",
      "originalText": "# Introduction\n\n## Structure\n### C1.P1 · Prescribing behavior\n| Bullet | Point          | Evidence |\n|--------|----------------|----------|\n| B1     | Set importance | None     |\n| B2     | Show variation | E01      |\n\n## Scratch\n### C1.P1\n- Clarify the comparison.\n- Keep the opening focused.\n\n## Draft\n### C1.P1 · Prescribing behavior\nWrite the paragraph here as ordinary\nprose, with its evidence citations.",
